WEBVTT

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:33.280
Title: Rescue! Friends of Shinobi Go Through Thick and Thin Together

00:01:45.640 --> 00:01:48.350
so she heads straight to the Village of Mist to rescue them.

00:01:48.910 --> 00:01:53.850
"Shikimi-san, Azami-chan, Yusura-chan, Himeji-san, please be all right."

00:01:54.150 --> 00:01:59.010
That's what Himawari shouts out in her heart as she runs.

00:01:59.010 --> 00:02:03.950
She runs and runs with her caring master, Hayato.

00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:13.470
And finally, ta-da, they arrive at the enemy's base.

00:02:13.470 --> 00:02:16.000
Tsukiyohime-san, do you find this entertaining?

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:19.570
I'm making it sound good because I'm bored.

00:02:20.110 --> 00:02:21.380
But it's almost time now.

00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:26.350
Momota!

00:02:26.350 --> 00:02:28.070
I'm glad you got here safely.

00:02:28.070 --> 00:02:29.290
Tsukiyohime-san!

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:30.720
Yonezawa-kun!

00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:33.060
Where are Yusura-chan and the others?

00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:35.890
A kappa!

00:02:35.890 --> 00:02:38.050
Don't call me a kappa.

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:41.400
They went in and never came back.

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:43.780
They went in there?

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:46.150
It's pitch-black inside.

00:02:49.610 --> 00:02:52.960
By the way, Tsukiyohime, what's up with this letter?

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:55.980
You made it sound like it was Himawari's fault that the others were captured.

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:58.310
I just wrote the truth.

00:02:58.310 --> 00:02:59.000
By the way,

00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:03.210
that letter seems to have raised your spirits a bit.

00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:05.080
More than a bit.

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:07.920
Tsukiyohime-san, thank you very much.

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:11.590
Be careful when you go.

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:13.100
Right!

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:17.520
Hey, aren't you going?

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:20.990
I don't want to waste unnecessary energy.

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:26.140
Hasn't eating so much rice restored your strength?!

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:27.460
Good grief...

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:31.450
You guys stay here.

00:03:32.460 --> 00:03:34.010
Again?

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:38.300
If Momojiri and a kappa go along, you'll attract attention.

00:03:38.300 --> 00:03:40.750
Don't call me a kappa. I'm Yonezawa.

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:55.470
This is...

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:58.610
Right, we were...

00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:17.830
Who's there?!

00:04:25.340 --> 00:04:30.380
Then the teachers from Shinobi Gakuen attacked your village?

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:33.550
You can't trust anyone these days.

00:04:33.550 --> 00:04:36.580
I even thought that you might be an enemy.

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:40.730
If I were an enemy, then I wouldn't be locked up here, right?

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:44.730
That's true... I think.

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:48.030
Let's break out of here.

00:04:48.030 --> 00:04:51.310
Do you have a plan?

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:56.660
I could ask Momota to call for help, but I left him behind.

00:04:56.660 --> 00:05:01.410
I want to meet Wabisuke and Boss once more before I die.

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:06.210
I don't think they're going to kill us.

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:08.210
They're not?

00:05:08.460 --> 00:05:12.510
Perhaps... they might modify us into really weird ninjas.

00:05:12.510 --> 00:05:15.620
For example, a transparent person whose ears won't disappear,

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:18.910
or a squirrel-man that shape-shifts after seeing okonomiyaki,

00:05:18.910 --> 00:05:22.090
or a gummy-man with a squishy body.

00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:28.780
W-We have to escape before that happens.

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:33.280
That's useless.

00:05:33.920 --> 00:05:36.720
I did as much digging as I could.

00:05:39.470 --> 00:05:40.670
You're right.

00:05:40.670 --> 00:05:42.450
It's as full of holes as a mound of mole burrows.

00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:44.360
The stone floor is just for show.

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:47.240
What's underneath is too hard for us to dig through.

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:50.230
Then we'll get out through the walls.

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:55.090
I tried that too.

00:05:56.970 --> 00:06:01.260
In fact, this room is a metal cage.

00:06:01.260 --> 00:06:03.250
There's no way out.

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:05.630
We can do it as long as we don't give up.

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:11.140
Get out of here?

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:11.800
But how?

00:06:14.120 --> 00:06:20.390
Even if you think you've done enough, you still have to try your best until your strength is gone.

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:23.350
I'm almost there.

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:25.190
Just a bit more.

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:31.990
<i>She told me that.</i>

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:35.170
If we can't get through the floor or the walls, there's still the ceiling.

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:39.350
Well?

00:06:46.030 --> 00:06:49.220
When it sounds like that, it means the watermelon is hollow and inedible.

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:50.720
That's what grandma...

00:06:52.650 --> 00:06:55.190
Bingo! It's hollow here.

00:06:56.890 --> 00:07:02.500
According to my information, Komurasaki-kun has experience with getting caught and escaping.

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:03.700
I'm pinning my hopes on you.

00:07:04.850 --> 00:07:08.320
Every prison is built differently.

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:12.200
There's no guarantee that what worked before will work again.

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:16.330
You're really conceited, just like Himawari.

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:19.550
Hey, why did you fall for Himawari?

00:07:19.550 --> 00:07:21.140
Is this the right time to ask that?

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:22.140
Feel the mood.

00:07:22.140 --> 00:07:30.630
I wonder why someone as dumb and dense as you would fall for someone as dim-witted and clumsy as Himawari.

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:32.880
Th-Those are her good points.

00:07:32.880 --> 00:07:36.570
Although she's a bit dim-witted and clumsy...

00:07:36.570 --> 00:07:38.450
she always does her best.

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:44.220
When I see her smile, it gives me courage, and I feel I can keep on going.

00:07:44.220 --> 00:07:48.180
Just like her namesake, she has a heart like a sunflower:

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:51.670
it grows up strong and healthy, facing the sun.

00:07:52.290 --> 00:07:53.370
Eh?

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:55.290
Could this be...

00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:58.150
She never listens to others.

00:07:58.150 --> 00:07:59.330
Look.

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:01.010
Is this some kind of secret code?

00:08:03.570 --> 00:08:05.580
What a lame drawing.

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:08.020
Perhaps a previous captive left it behind.

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:11.400
If we can decipher the message, maybe we can escape.

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:15.240
I don't think it will be that easy.

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:17.900
Um...

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:19.710
Eye.

00:08:19.710 --> 00:08:21.190
Hawk.

00:08:21.190 --> 00:08:22.360
No.

00:08:22.360 --> 00:08:23.900
Guts pose.

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:26.470
Crane?

00:08:26.470 --> 00:08:27.720
Teeth?

00:08:27.720 --> 00:08:29.030
What's that?

00:08:29.030 --> 00:08:33.710
Eye, hawk, no, guts, crane, teeth?

00:08:33.710 --> 00:08:40.670
♪ Me taka no gatsu kou ha kawa no naka. ♪

00:08:33.710 --> 00:08:40.670
Note: The opening line of a Japanese nursery rhyme: "The school of Medaka fish is in the river."

00:08:40.670 --> 00:08:41.940
No way.

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:43.720
That's why there's a gap between "ka" and "wa."

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:47.290
From any angle, it's a stupid code that makes you look like an idiot.

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:50.730
♪ Let's take a peek inside. ♪ 

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:52.690
Impossible.

00:08:55.590 --> 00:08:56.330
I did it.

00:08:56.330 --> 00:08:57.440
N-No way!

00:09:14.230 --> 00:09:16.030
The security sure is tight.

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:19.990
That's because people broke in this way before.

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:25.660
All the security holes have been patched up.

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:27.970
It means that the enemy's not stupid.

00:09:28.640 --> 00:09:31.020
It seems we'll have to force our way in from the front.

00:09:31.020 --> 00:09:32.920
That's too rash.

00:09:33.480 --> 00:09:35.730
You idiot, what are you doing?

00:09:35.730 --> 00:09:37.460
What are you doing to Hayato-dono?

00:09:37.460 --> 00:09:39.410
Wabisuke, get Himawari.

00:09:41.860 --> 00:09:44.460
Wh-Who are you guys?

00:09:44.460 --> 00:09:46.090
I want to make a deal.

00:09:46.090 --> 00:09:50.860
I heard that your bosses are searching frantically for these two.

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:51.810
Hold on.

00:09:51.810 --> 00:09:53.050
I need to identify them.

00:10:00.260 --> 00:10:02.530
Indeed, they <i>are the ones we want.</i>

00:10:02.530 --> 00:10:03.590
What are you proposing?

00:10:03.590 --> 00:10:07.360
I want to exchange these two for our friends.

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:10.100
You've betrayed us.

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:15.480
You were pretending to be our friends from the beginning, right?

00:10:15.480 --> 00:10:16.390
Okay.

00:10:16.390 --> 00:10:18.120
I don't think there will be a problem.

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:18.980
Come in!

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:28.360
Boss,

00:10:28.360 --> 00:10:32.560
at this rate we'll end up handing these two over.

00:10:33.510 --> 00:10:34.980
What?

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:38.460
But once we get inside, we'll have the upper hand.

00:10:38.460 --> 00:10:40.320
What's this nonsense?

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:43.050
I'm saying that I won't hold back!

00:10:43.970 --> 00:10:45.020
What?!

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:52.930
What are you doing?!

00:10:54.310 --> 00:10:55.390
I'm here too.

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:02.510
I'm hungry.

00:11:02.510 --> 00:11:04.690
I want something to eat.

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:06.710
You're a noisy bitch!

00:11:06.710 --> 00:11:11.390
Even in foreign countries, prisons have to provide meals.

00:11:11.390 --> 00:11:14.050
Food. Food. Food.

00:11:14.050 --> 00:11:16.840
I want something to eat!

00:11:17.680 --> 00:11:20.080
Get her something.

00:11:21.400 --> 00:11:22.800
Here, eat!

00:11:23.030 --> 00:11:26.700
I'm still a growing girl.

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:28.820
Itadakimasu.

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:34.630
I think I've tasted this before.

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:36.560
I wonder what it was.

00:11:37.280 --> 00:11:44.070
It was kind of like this, an irritating feeling just like when a mosquito bites the bottom of my foot.

00:11:44.510 --> 00:11:46.570
Try some.

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:49.530
It's just potato soup.

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:52.640
I remember!

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:04.670
If you inhale even a little bit of this odor, you'll fall sound asleep.

00:12:04.670 --> 00:12:06.200
It's the smell of Shishinemuri grass.

00:12:08.320 --> 00:12:15.140
All of you here today have received clearance for our magnificent project.

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:19.810
The government has entrusted your future to us.

00:12:19.810 --> 00:12:22.850
Ninjas are no longer out-dated.

00:12:22.850 --> 00:12:29.390
We would like to maximize each and every one of your extraordinary abilities.

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:35.230
So let's start by showing you some examples.

00:12:38.750 --> 00:12:45.210
If we combine our technology and your abilities, we can create great business opportunities.

00:12:45.540 --> 00:12:47.890
We're not experimental animals!

00:12:47.890 --> 00:12:49.320
That's not what we agreed to!

00:12:49.320 --> 00:12:51.880
I don't want to be turned into one of these monsters!

00:12:53.420 --> 00:12:57.310
Of course, we will also provide compensation.

00:12:57.310 --> 00:13:06.770
But if you can't preserve your ninja abilities, your very existence will be meaningless.

00:13:07.060 --> 00:13:10.890
What was the purpose of us going through all that stringent training?

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:14.400
If you take away our existence as ninjas, we'll have no reason to live.

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:16.440
Please extend our abilities even further.

00:13:16.440 --> 00:13:19.990
I don't mind, provided you can make me stronger than before.

00:13:19.990 --> 00:13:22.770
Ninjas have to be useful to someone.

00:13:22.770 --> 00:13:27.970
We will only obey our employer,
even if it's a government organization.

00:13:29.600 --> 00:13:30.250
Me too...

00:13:49.340 --> 00:13:50.320
What's happening?

00:13:50.320 --> 00:13:51.110
Hang in there!

00:13:57.730 --> 00:13:59.210
This looks like Shikimi's bag.

00:13:59.780 --> 00:14:03.200
Do you know Shikimi?

00:14:03.200 --> 00:14:04.360
Yes.

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:07.790
Were you Shikimi's teacher?

00:14:13.420 --> 00:14:15.120
Aconite!

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:16.090
Why did you take poison?

00:14:17.670 --> 00:14:19.150
Drink this. You can still pull through.

00:14:19.150 --> 00:14:20.670
It's the antidote.

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:24.490
I want to ask you for a favor.

00:14:24.490 --> 00:14:29.240
Please feed my corpse to the birds,

00:14:29.240 --> 00:14:32.780
and erase all traces of my life from this world.

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:36.490
Why are you taking your own life?

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:42.520
Did you see those modified ninjas?

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:49.150
I don't want to live as a disgraced warrior.

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:50.430
You mustn't die!

00:14:50.430 --> 00:14:53.160
Shikimi... Shikimi will be sad!

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:55.920
What are you to her?

00:14:55.920 --> 00:14:58.370
No... This isn't the time for that.

00:14:59.140 --> 00:15:00.010
Teacher!

00:15:00.010 --> 00:15:01.460
Stop acting as if you know me.

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:04.520
You're not qualified to call me that!

00:15:07.370 --> 00:15:15.150
Please... Feed my corpse... to the birds.

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:17.280
Someone! Someone, please come!

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:19.030
What is it?

00:15:19.030 --> 00:15:19.820
What happened?

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:28.290
He's...

00:15:30.010 --> 00:15:31.260
dead.

00:15:34.100 --> 00:15:35.700
What happened to the other guy?!

00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:38.320
He couldn't have gone far.

00:15:38.320 --> 00:15:39.900
Split up and search!

00:15:53.210 --> 00:15:55.530
Where is everyone?

00:15:55.530 --> 00:15:57.540
It's like a maze.

00:15:57.540 --> 00:16:01.090
By the way, Himeji, don't you think your head looks weird?

00:16:01.090 --> 00:16:03.650
This clothing doesn't suit me.

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:08.920
Let's ask them.

00:16:08.920 --> 00:16:10.940
Great work, guys!

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:14.750
Where are all those kunoichi?

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:20.840
What are you doing?

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:28.400
No way...

00:16:28.650 --> 00:16:30.450
What have you guys done?

00:16:30.450 --> 00:16:31.990
What's wrong?

00:16:32.450 --> 00:16:34.440
What have you done to my master?

00:16:37.450 --> 00:16:39.750
Shikimi, is it? Calm down.

00:16:39.750 --> 00:16:42.840
Your teacher took his own life with aconite.

00:16:42.840 --> 00:16:44.220
Nanafushi.

00:16:44.220 --> 00:16:47.720
He died after telling me to feed his corpse to the birds.

00:16:47.720 --> 00:16:49.920
You should at least fulfill his last wish.

00:16:50.990 --> 00:16:52.520
No way.

00:16:52.520 --> 00:16:53.710
My teacher...

00:16:55.260 --> 00:16:57.590
Shikimi, this is your meal.

00:16:58.460 --> 00:16:59.900
Itadakimasu.

00:17:01.010 --> 00:17:03.800
Teacher, it smells funny.

00:17:04.070 --> 00:17:06.330
We're living in retreat.

00:17:06.330 --> 00:17:08.270
You can't be picky.

00:17:08.270 --> 00:17:09.290
Yes.

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:13.900
Teacher, my tongue's gone numb.

00:17:13.900 --> 00:17:16.270
It's a valuable meal.

00:17:16.270 --> 00:17:18.360
Don't waste it.

00:17:18.360 --> 00:17:19.610
Yes.

00:17:20.780 --> 00:17:24.460
That's the taste of Nekomataki.

00:17:20.780 --> 00:17:24.460
Note: Nekomataki means "A fish so bad that even a cat avoids it."

00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:26.070
Don't forget that.

00:17:26.760 --> 00:17:28.280
Yes...

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:38.870
They're impostors!

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:40.120
Damn you.

00:17:45.180 --> 00:17:45.740
Oh no!

00:17:45.740 --> 00:17:47.260
Shut up.

00:17:48.260 --> 00:17:49.190
They're here!

00:17:49.190 --> 00:17:50.640
Don't let them escape!

00:17:51.810 --> 00:17:54.890
Apparently, this disguise won't be sufficient.

00:17:54.890 --> 00:17:57.160
Let's do it in style.

00:17:59.020 --> 00:18:02.270
I'll ward them off!

00:18:02.270 --> 00:18:03.980
Shikimi, are you okay?

00:18:05.370 --> 00:18:06.320
Please go.

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:07.900
But...

00:18:08.560 --> 00:18:11.520
Please take care of my master.

00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:12.540
Got it.

00:18:22.300 --> 00:18:24.220
Okay. Don't move!

00:18:31.350 --> 00:18:36.130
Offense is the best defense.

00:18:37.060 --> 00:18:37.930
Search carefully!

00:18:37.930 --> 00:18:39.370
Where did she go?!

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:46.200
These guns are useless. They run out of bullets too fast.

00:18:48.290 --> 00:18:50.400
What are you doing?

00:18:52.220 --> 00:18:54.920
Let go. Let me go!

00:18:57.110 --> 00:18:59.200
Ninja Technique: Cat Claws!

00:18:58.270 --> 00:18:59.200
It's me!

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:00.360
Calm down, Himeji.

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:01.720
It's me.

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:05.720
Himeji-san.

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:07.760
Himawari!

00:19:07.760 --> 00:19:09.370
Why are you guys here?

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:13.180
I heard from Tsukiyohime-san that everyone had been captured, so I rushed here.

00:19:14.350 --> 00:19:15.680
I see.

00:19:16.010 --> 00:19:18.350
Himeji-san, I'm glad you're safe!

00:19:18.960 --> 00:19:24.990
But I got separated from Shikimi,
and I don't know where the others are.

00:19:25.500 --> 00:19:27.460
Let's go and save everyone!

00:19:28.610 --> 00:19:31.090
Ouch!

00:19:33.340 --> 00:19:40.540
I don't think the plan will go smoothly,
with everyone volunteering to join us.

00:19:41.940 --> 00:19:47.530
To be safe, repeat this a few more times.
Then the brainwashing will be complete.

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:50.290
They've escaped.

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:52.980
Catch them before you make such a boring report.

00:19:52.980 --> 00:19:54.020
Yes, sir!

00:19:59.040 --> 00:20:02.440
Of those who escaped,

00:20:03.310 --> 00:20:04.410
only she's been caught.

00:20:11.360 --> 00:20:14.600
Let's make her a lesson to the other escapees.

00:20:33.230 --> 00:20:35.190
How is everyone?

00:20:35.190 --> 00:20:38.840
Let's celebrate a memorable start to our project.

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:47.040
We're going to modify this kunoichi candidate and turn her into an outstanding super-ninja.

00:21:05.010 --> 00:21:10.850
This device will amplify her emotional wounds and project them back on her forcefully.

00:21:10.850 --> 00:21:16.470
She'll have to overcome this, or run away.

00:21:16.470 --> 00:21:21.200
That injury to her self-esteem becomes the driving force for creating wonderful abilities

00:21:21.200 --> 00:21:23.800
in a form that suits her best.

00:21:26.770 --> 00:21:27.920
For example,

00:21:28.390 --> 00:21:33.040
this kunoichi went for a date after eating okonomiyaki.

00:21:35.840 --> 00:21:37.840
You had okonomiyaki?

00:21:38.040 --> 00:21:39.020
Yes.

00:21:39.700 --> 00:21:41.740
You have seaweed stuck in your teeth.

00:21:49.680 --> 00:21:52.310
Ever since then, she's concealed her smile.

00:21:52.310 --> 00:21:58.050
Whenever she sees okonomiyaki, the hatred deriving from that trauma gives her the power

00:21:58.050 --> 00:22:02.060
to turn into a giant squirrel and manipulate shock waves.

00:22:05.380 --> 00:22:09.340
And this ninja's much anticipated gumball got stepped on.

00:22:09.600 --> 00:22:15.880
The trauma of being bullied has given him a body that can be stretched like gum.

00:22:17.960 --> 00:22:19.650
Stop!

00:22:23.750 --> 00:22:28.660
Now, let's see what traumas this kunoichi has experienced.

00:24:10.920 --> 00:24:17.950
In order to rescue Shikimi-san, who is sleeping in a capsule to be remade into a super-ninja,

00:24:17.950 --> 00:24:20.920
I will go! I will leap! I will run!

00:24:20.920 --> 00:24:23.590
Hey, wake up, Shikimi-san.

00:24:24.640 --> 00:24:27.610
What do you mean, "It's okay to be modified"?

00:24:27.610 --> 00:24:29.480
Is that what you wanted?

00:24:29.480 --> 00:24:31.070
What happened, Shikimi-san?

00:24:31.970 --> 00:24:32.480
Next time:

00:24:32.910 --> 00:24:36.050
"Final Battle: Master and Servant's Eternal Vows."

00:24:36.050 --> 00:24:36.980
Hayato-dono,

00:24:37.210 --> 00:24:38.790
it's the final battle!
